1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 32]</font>

15
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well.</font>

16
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

17
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be your sister-in-law, right?</font>

18
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying,</font>

19
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did you do this willingly?</font>

20
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If His Majesty had chosen another lady</font>

21
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to marry Mobai,</font>

22
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I reckon</font>

23
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd have to arrange an assassination.</font>

24
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

25
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

26
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On behalf of my father</font>

27
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and my family, I apologize.</font>

28
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father</font>

29
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has already faced his punishment.</font>

30
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

31
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know I shouldn't hope
for your forgiveness.</font>

32
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the moment I saw you,</font>

33
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't help wanting
to speak with you.</font>

34
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's done is done.</font>

35
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we ever go back to how things were?</font>

36
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

37
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin.</font>

38
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My sister has been rude.</font>

39
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please forgive her, Miss Qin.</font>

40
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

41
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

42
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wasn't finished talking to her.</font>

43
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your identity is special.</font>

44
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't wander around outside.</font>

45
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of me.</font>

46
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Post Station]</font>

47
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That charming look of yours</font>

48
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could rival the top courtesan
of the pleasure house.</font>

49
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's more to it than that.</font>

50
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My dear, would you like</font>

51
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to give it a try?</font>

52
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My hair's almost turned white
from worry.</font>

53
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you still be
in the mood to joke?</font>

54
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hair turned white?</font>

55
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is it white?</font>

56
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me help you find it.</font>

57
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

58
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still want to sleep
in the bed tonight?</font>

59
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, alright.</font>

60
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

61
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one is the brother you respect most.</font>

62
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Jiang siblings</font>

63
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are your dearest friends.</font>

64
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must have faith in them.</font>

65
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter how much others wish to help,</font>

66
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's little they can truly do.</font>

67
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything was perfectly fine.</font>

68
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could it all fall apart</font>

69
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">overnight?</font>

70
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life is unpredictable.</font>

71
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if hearts stay true,</font>

72
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bonds can endure.</font>

73
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Post Station]</font>

74
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The day has barely dawned.</font>

75
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why the rush to leave?</font>

76
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't even finished my hair.</font>

77
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since we can't stand
the sight of each other,</font>

78
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's best we part ways.</font>

79
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

80
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not going up.</font>

81
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move, move!</font>

82
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're far too impatient.</font>

83
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

84
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move out!</font>

85
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring me my horse.</font>

86
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young General.</font>

87
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:09,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. and Mrs. Li.</font>

88
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today,</font>

89
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why is it so deserted here?</font>

90
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Li,</font>

91
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the wedding procession
left early this morning.</font>

92
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, the place emptied out all at once.</font>

93
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chief means to avoid us on purpose.</font>

94
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about</font>

95
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we stay another night?</font>

96
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My eyes!</font>

97
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My eyes!</font>

98
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Protect the Young General!</font>

99
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

100
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son!</font>

101
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son!</font>

102
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son!</font>

103
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't hurt him.</font>

104
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He hasn't lost his mind.</font>

105
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's just sick.</font>

106
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son, your mother is here.</font>

107
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be afraid.</font>

108
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:45,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Madam,</font>

109
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what happened to your son's eyes?</font>

110
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday, they were just red.</font>

111
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When he woke up this morning,</font>

112
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he couldn't see a thing.</font>

113
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He couldn't accept it,</font>

114
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which is why he's like this now.</font>

115
00:05:59,320 --> 00:05:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful.</font>

116
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Madam,</font>

117
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take your son to see a physician.</font>

118
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes.</font>

119
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for your guidance.</font>

120
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son, we have money now.</font>

121
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come, let me take you to a physician.</font>

122
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

123
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That one looks fun.</font>

124
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't have those back home.</font>

125
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:33,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little rabbit.</font>

126
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan, where are we now?</font>

127
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Jifu Village.</font>

128
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're in Xizhao now.</font>

129
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does that mean I'm</font>

130
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about to see Mobai?</font>

131
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no, I can't eat any more.</font>

132
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You eat it.</font>

133
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When Mobai lifts the veil,</font>

134
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll see a chubby woman.</font>

135
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm done eating.</font>

136
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

137
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He'd rather you didn't marry him.</font>

138
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just think about it.</font>

139
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would he want to see</font>

140
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the face of his enemy's daughter?</font>

141
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, on the way here,</font>

142
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've been rushing non-stop,</font>

143
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to avoid Jun, right?</font>

144
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you the clever one?</font>

145
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan, you're such a coward.</font>

146
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why can't you just talk it out?</font>

147
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Must you hide from her forever?</font>

148
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have failed the Qin family.</font>

149
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have failed the Li family.</font>

150
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if we meet,</font>

151
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it'd only serve to remind everyone</font>

152
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of those painful memories.</font>

153
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why cause everyone more grief?</font>

154
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cause everyone grief?</font>

155
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it's you who can't bear it.</font>

156
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the only one who can't move on.</font>

157
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come, come.</font>

158
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear customers,</font>

159
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what would you like to eat?</font>

160
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Red braised pork, lion's head meatball.</font>

161
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sweet and sour spareribs,
braised pig trotters.</font>

162
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Soy sauce duck,
pig's knuckle, ribbonfish.</font>

163
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just bring everything except vegetables.</font>

164
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My apologies.</font>

165
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lately, we only serve vegetarian dishes.</font>

166
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of diner is this?</font>

167
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you open without meat?</font>

168
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two aren't from Xizhao, are you?</font>

169
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you know?</font>

170
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Recently,</font>

171
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a strange illness
has spread across Xizhao.</font>

172
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's called red eye disease.</font>

173
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the early stages,
the eyes redden and ache unbearably.</font>

174
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the later stages,
one weeps blood without end,</font>

175
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gradually losing sight.</font>

176
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No physician or medicine can help.</font>

177
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chengtian Sect prayed for three days</font>

178
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and received a divine oracle.</font>

179
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It calls upon all subjects of Xizhao</font>

180
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to abstain from meat for a month
and take no lives.</font>

181
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:17,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those who are blind shall see again.</font>

182
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that all?</font>

183
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If skipping meat
for a month restores sight,</font>

184
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then I'll give it up for life.</font>

185
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would that make me immortal?</font>

186
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dare question the divine oracle?</font>

187
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying,</font>

188
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">say no more.</font>

189
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Waiter,</font>

190
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bring our dishes, please.</font>

191
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why can't I speak my mind?</font>

192
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:34,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Illness calls for medicine
and a physician.</font>

193
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Doesn't Jun always say</font>

194
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all this talk of ghosts and gods</font>

195
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is just mystifying nonsense?</font>

196
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tricks to fool the gullible.</font>

197
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you believe it?</font>

198
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you stop bringing her up?</font>

199
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why can't I?</font>

200
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made myself perfectly clear earlier.</font>

201
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show some sense. This is Xizhao.</font>

202
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What of it?</font>

203
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the point of telling me?</font>

204
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then right now,</font>

205
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">turn back with me
to Guanzhou post station.</font>

206
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you dare repeat what you just said</font>

207
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Li Congyao and Jun to their faces?</font>

208
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- The sacred maid is here!
- The sacred maid is here!</font>

209
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady.</font>

210
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady.</font>

211
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

212
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm still sitting right here.</font>

213
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are they looking at?</font>

214
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bigger entrance than mine?
I can't stand it.</font>

215
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Yaoji, the sacred maid</font>

216
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of the Chengtian Sect.</font>

217
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lady Yaoji</font>

218
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the sacred maid of Chengtian Sect,</font>

219
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">revered by the local people here.</font>

220
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even our Great Emperor
must show her respect.</font>

221
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- The sacred maid is here.
- My Lady.</font>

222
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady.</font>

223
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:33,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here again.</font>

224
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just as I thought,
all smoke and mirrors.</font>

225
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you to hold your tongue.</font>

226
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still at it?</font>

227
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

228
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady,</font>

229
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the plague in Guanzhou is severe.</font>

230
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord has sent us
to Guanzhou at once</font>

231
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to calm the afflicted people.</font>

232
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother.</font>

233
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother.</font>

234
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In just a single day,</font>

235
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so many have contracted
the red eye disease.</font>

236
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suspect this disease</font>

237
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is highly contagious.</font>

238
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, remain calm.</font>

239
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are the army stationed
at Guanzhou's border.</font>

240
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're here to assess the situation
for the prefecture.</font>

241
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those with the red eye disease,</font>

242
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">first follow us to the assembly point</font>

243
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">set up by the prefectural office.</font>

244
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. and Mrs. Li,</font>

245
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with this happening,</font>

246
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must travel the road ahead alone.</font>

247
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please be extremely careful.</font>

248
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are a day's journey from Xizhao.</font>

249
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This red eye disease is far too strange.</font>

250
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must tell the brothers in the camp</font>

251
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to stay safe.</font>

252
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

253
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For those with the red eye disease,</font>

254
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's best to cover their eyes
with black cloth.</font>

255
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It might help control the spread.</font>

256
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many thanks for the advice.</font>

257
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will relay it to General Meng.</font>

258
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must both be careful.</font>

259
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gouzi.</font>

260
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gouzi.</font>

261
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother.</font>

262
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You always make me worry.</font>

263
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I tell you to stay in the room?</font>

264
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so dangerous outside.</font>

265
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you both so much.</font>

266
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, I can't imagine</font>

267
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what might have happened to my son.</font>

268
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was nothing, really.</font>

269
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Benefactors,</font>

270
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could I trouble you</font>

271
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to watch the child a little longer?</font>

272
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My husband left early this morning</font>

273
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and hasn't returned yet.</font>

274
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm worried about him.</font>

275
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave the child with us.</font>

276
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go, hurry.</font>

277
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:27,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, thank you.</font>

278
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Madam,</font>

279
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we have no experience with children.</font>

280
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please return as quickly as you can.</font>

281
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, alright.</font>

282
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gouzi, you be good now.</font>

283
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to find your father.</font>

284
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There now, Gouzi.</font>

285
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go up first, alright?</font>

286
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

287
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you staring at?</font>

288
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you staring at?</font>

289
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

290
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of me.</font>

291
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:27,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He bit me first.</font>

292
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw everything.</font>

293
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You pinched his face first.</font>

294
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

295
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some water first, alright?</font>

296
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:46,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go play by yourself.</font>

297
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have no time for you.</font>

298
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go there.</font>

299
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gouzi?</font>

300
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gouzi?</font>

301
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, kid.</font>

302
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you out here all alone?</font>

303
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gouzi.</font>

304
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you say something
before running off?</font>

305
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come inside with me, now.</font>

306
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young General,</font>

307
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">long time no see.</font>

308
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao?</font>

309
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:06,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao?</font>

310
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gouzi.</font>

311
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, Mother.</font>

312
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here by yourself?</font>

313
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just saw a fairy sister.</font>

314
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What fairy sister?</font>

315
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

316
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've finally found my husband.</font>

317
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm glad you found him.</font>

318
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

319
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where has my husband gone?</font>

320
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The big brother was taken
by the fairy sister.</font>

321
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

322
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go look for him.</font>

323
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Marrying Duke Dingguo's daughter?</font>

324
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why was I never told of this?</font>

325
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had feelings</font>

326
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for Princess Minghua in Beiyuan.</font>

327
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I sought a marriage alliance there,</font>

328
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">precisely because you were alone.</font>

329
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:51,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear you'd be lonely.</font>

330
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This lets lovers unite in marriage</font>

331
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and also allows Beiyuan and Xizhao</font>

332
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a century of peace.</font>

333
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two gains with one move.</font>

334
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would you object?</font>

335
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo is the mastermind</font>

336
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who framed my family in Beiyuan.</font>

337
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this true?</font>

338
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

339
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Between Duke Dingguo and me,</font>

340
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the hatred runs too deep.</font>

341
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My feelings for Princess Minghua</font>

342
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are of the past.</font>

343
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forcing me to marry her</font>

344
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">won't lead to the harmony you desire.</font>

345
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you to rescind your order.</font>

346
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let the wedding procession
waiting outside the city</font>

347
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">return home as soon as possible.</font>

348
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A marriage alliance
is no trifling matter.</font>

349
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is no longer
about your personal feelings.</font>

350
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is a pact between two nations.</font>

351
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if you send</font>

352
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the wedding procession back,</font>

353
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'll be a princess rejected
by a Xizhao prince.</font>

354
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who would dare marry her then?</font>

355
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you truly hate her so much</font>

356
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you would ruin her entire life?</font>

357
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I marry her,</font>

358
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that would truly ruin her life.</font>

359
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son, do you realize</font>

360
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that a plague is spreading
across the borderlands?</font>

361
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A plague?</font>

362
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's called the red eye disease.</font>

363
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's aggressive and spreads fast.</font>

364
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't escort
the wedding procession back asap,</font>

365
00:16:06,920 --> 00:16:09,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Princess Minghua gets infected,</font>

366
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xizhao will be held responsible.</font>

367
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

368
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Waiter!</font>

369
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you taking advantage
of my blindness?</font>

370
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are the tea leaves?</font>

371
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is just plain water.
Who would drink this?</font>

372
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One moment, sir.</font>

373
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll brew a fresh pot for you.</font>

374
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be quick about it.</font>

375
00:17:05,360 --> 00:17:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's a sickly one doing here?</font>

376
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go cough outside.</font>

377
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So many have fallen ill lately.</font>

378
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You might spread it to us.</font>

379
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you understand?</font>

380
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked you to get out.</font>

381
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today must be my lucky day.</font>

382
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I come for tea and find
a stunning beauty.</font>

383
00:17:33,840 --> 00:17:34,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go.</font>

384
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, beauty.</font>

385
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:36,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me take you to a physician.</font>

386
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost.</font>

387
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should've known better.</font>

388
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't blame me for being rude.</font>

389
00:17:45,490 --> 00:17:47,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

390
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:49,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

391
00:17:50,030 --> 00:17:53,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

392
00:17:53,950 --> 00:17:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

393
00:17:58,630 --> 00:18:01,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

394
00:18:02,610 --> 00:18:06,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

395
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

396
00:18:11,470 --> 00:18:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

397
00:18:19,610 --> 00:18:23,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

398
00:18:24,280 --> 00:18:27,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

399
00:18:28,330 --> 00:18:32,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

400
00:18:32,870 --> 00:18:35,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

401
00:18:36,850 --> 00:18:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

402
00:18:41,450 --> 00:18:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
